      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DASH STRATUS (1) eye-catching debut run after settling well back but winding up strongly into the frame when third (22.54) at this track over 380m. Drops down the inside box this time. Should be further improved and rates on top this time. BODHI BUZZ (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 2.25 lengths behind Footloose in 22.07 and recording a new PB here. Looks a leading chance again. MISS BRIMLEY (6) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden after six starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing fourth (22.20) at this track. Cannot be taken lightly. MALI'S BIG BOY (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
